@startuml
title Lab 1 从上电到首行输出
hide footbox
participant "QEMU 引导 ROM\n0x1000" as ROM
participant "entry.S 入口\nM 态汇编" as Entry
participant "start()\nM 态 C 函数" as Start
participant "kernel_main()\nS 态" as Main
participant "UART0\n0x10000000" as UART

ROM -> Entry : 跳转到 ELF 入口 0x80000000
activate Entry
Entry -> Entry : 关闭 M 态中断；读取 mhartid
note right of Entry
  非零 hart 留在 park
  以下为 hart 0
end note
Entry -> Entry : mtvec = mtrap；清零 BSS
Entry -> Entry : sp = stack0_top（4 KB 栈）
Entry -> Start : call start
deactivate Entry
activate Start
Start -> Start : mstatus.MPP = S；MIE、MPIE、SIE = 0
Start -> Start : mepc = kernel_main
Start -> Start : 委托异常与中断；stvec = strap
Start -> Start : satp = 0（Bare）；sfence.vma
Start -> Start : PMP 授予 S 态读、写、执行权限
Start -> Main : mret：切换到 S 态，从 mepc 取指
deactivate Start
activate Main
Main -> UART : kprintf → consoleputc
note over Main,UART
  轮询 LSR bit 5，待 THRE = 1
  再写 THR，终端出现 OSLAB1 首行
end note
Main -> Main : 输出两行自检，随后 wfi 等待
deactivate Main
@enduml
